{"title":"Tantra Toronto","startsAt":"2026-10-11T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-11T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**To register and get details please send a message beforehand to the group: t.me/TorontoTantra, t.me/AndyTherapist.**\n**Registration a few days before the event is required.**\n\n**Sunday Aug 16th 7-10pm**\n\n**Doors at 6:50**\n**Doors close at 7:10.**\n\n**WHAT TO EXPECT**\n\n**6:50 doors open**\n**7:10 pm doors close**\n**7:20- 9:40pm 8 we drop in, share, make requests on what we'd like to learn + experience & get to practice!**\n**10pm event closes**\n\n**ABOUT THE EVENT**\n**Come get the education in sxuality you never got, but wish you had 💥**\n\n**The education we get in sxuality from school is so limited. We grow up seeking information often in all the wrong places.**\n\n**What if the conversation around sexuality was brought out in the open? What if it wasn't fraught with shame, with dogma?**\n\n**What if we learnt to identify our desires, our boundaries, how to have safe conversations around intimacy and this was common place?**\n\n**Tantric Drop ins is a community oriented workshop where you can come in as you are, drop in with community, rest, relax & play all the while learning these super important skills as well as some beginner friendly tantric practices.**\n**EXCHANGE: 55cad.**","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"T.me/TorontoTantra Circle","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/a/2/highres_535316226.jpeg"}